    "detailed_description": "Simultree is an incremental game about monitoring a life simulation.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3811840/extras/f081805bd8c223ae79f11a14bcb5e72d.poster.avif?t=1750344730\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3811840/extras/f081805bd8c223ae79f11a14bcb5e72d.webm?t=1750344730\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3811840/extras/f081805bd8c223ae79f11a14bcb5e72d.mp4?t=1750344730\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Run simulations to experiment with some entities that are\u00a0trying to survive by eating fruits and reproducing.<br></li><li>Unlock new entities, items, food and upgrade inside an endless tech tree.<br></li><li>Compete in an online leaderboard.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3811840/extras/44291bb5ef944c00d650262f2feb96a1.poster.avif?t=1750344730\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3811840/extras/44291bb5ef944c00d650262f2feb96a1.webm?t=1750344730\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3811840/extras/44291bb5ef944c00d650262f2feb96a1.mp4?t=1750344730\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3811840/extras/1695020e03d6fe7956e887425e20b42d.poster.avif?t=1750344730\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/a